# Optional. Fine-grained or classic PAT with NO extra scopes.
# Used only to call GitHub's GraphQL contributionsCollection.
#
# Vite inlines any VITE_ variable into the client bundle — do not use a token
# that can read private data. Leaving this unset is correct for GitHub Pages;
# the section then uses the public REST API + a public contributions feed.
VITE_GITHUB_TOKEN=
